$ cd tools/playtest && node qa-perf-vsync-off-probe.mjs http://127.0.0.1:<pinned-port>
(Chrome launched with --disable-gpu-vsync --disable-frame-rate-limit; raw
per-frame ms sampled directly via requestAnimationFrame timestamps, NOT the
game's own aggregated HB.perf(), for an independent reading. 12
fireWeapon('S', ..., clone=true) calls/frame to saturate the 256-slot bullet
pool, roster kept topped up to 10 live hostiles — two of each of the 5 kinds.)

